  "goodToKnow": "Die Liberalisierung is liberalisation or deregulation: die Liberalisierung des Strommarkts, des Handels, or relaxing laws (die Liberalisierung des Abtreibungsrechts). In Germany, the telephone monopoly of Deutsche Telekom ended in 1998, and the electricity market was opened the same year. The opposite is die Regulierung. Liberalisieren means to liberalise. Plural: die Liberalisierungen."
